# TODO: Verification Plan for GF(2¹⁶) Functions

## Overview

This document describes the TODO plan for verifying the functions and constants
listed in [`doc/truong/gf_functions.txt`](../truong/gf_functions.txt), which
enumerates all fully qualified function and constant names from
`src/encoding/gf.rs` (Rust source). These are extracted into
`Spqr/Code/Funs.lean` (Lean 4 / Aeneas extraction).

All extractable functions are configured via
[`aeneas-config.yml`](../../aeneas-config.yml). Functions not appearing in
that configuration (e.g. hardware-accelerated or `#[cfg(test)]` items) are
not extracted and therefore cannot be verified in the current framework.

