**None of these affect the GF(2¹⁶) verification.** The GF functions
use only fully-defined (no `sorry`) extracted code. Two axioms are
used in `DivImpl.lean`:

1. `IteratorRange_next_I32_ok` — asserts `Range<i32>::next` always
