   is opaque in the Aeneas extraction.
2. `IteratorRange_next_I32_post` — strengthens the above with the
   expected iterator semantics (start < end ⇒ yields start, advances by 1).

These are clearly documented in `Spqr/Specs/Encoding/Gf/GF16/DivImpl.lean`
and are sound axioms reflecting the known Rust behaviour of `Range<i32>`.

